: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.476px;\">\n            线下巡回杯测活动，11.30号开始，我会在以下城市游窜，欢迎来捕捉哈哈哈\n           </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.476px;\">\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n             ‍\n            </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;text-align: justify;margin: 0px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.476px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;text-align: justify;margin: 0px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.476px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n          线下活动形式：讲解+杯测\n         </span>\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;text-align: justify;margin: 0px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.476px;text-decoration: none;\">\n          豆子种类/数量：云南，哥伦的不同品种，处理方式，15支左右\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style='font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.476px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;'>\n</span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7TLlAQiaSe0OENxh85v7VlOK2kFSe5cSElCKDibZnXjADk8cex6nRfBQEQR4dkEgqorAH5ClyEwdO0g/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n<span style='color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: normal;caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-size: 14px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;'>\n</span>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=